            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapline 2.0.1</h2>
<p>A maintenance release that replaces the license signing key.</p>
<p>Licenses issued before this release no longer verify. If yours stops
working, request a replacement key &mdash; nothing about your purchase or
your captures is affected.</p>
]]></description>
